  "notes": "Reference contract for v148/predictable-reported-storage-quota. 2026-11-15 MDN-shape upgrade: verbatim Storage Standard IDL, Chromium M148 CalculateReportedQuota formula, corrected the exemption (special-storage-policy unlimited origins, not persisted()), BCD estimate() table with ChromeStatus interim column (no BCD entry for the behaviour), webstatus.dev banner.",
  "outOfScope": [
    {
      "name": "persist",
      "rationale": "StorageManager.persist() is quoted only as surrounding IDL context; Chromium M148 uses IsStorageUnlimited (quota_manager_impl.cc), not persistence, for the reported-quota exemption, and persist() behaviour is unchanged by this feature."
    },
    {
      "name": "persisted",
      "rationale": "StorageManager.persisted() is quoted only as surrounding IDL context; the page states it is not the exemption check, and its behaviour is unchanged by this feature."
    }
